  "description": "Account-wide star schema in ANALYTICS.care_management: report facts over shared dimensions, plus the bridges their slicers need. Every relationship runs on a *_key column (care and id packed into one integer), never on the bare id — ids are allocated per care and repeat across them. mart__dim_date is the only model without a source column (the care). mart__area_scope stands alone: an id bridge read only by the TenantArea RLS role, related to nothing. mart__all_carers_report keeps Pending and Archived carers, so it relates to its own two bridges (and to mart__dim_location), not to mart__dim_carer. mart__all_clients_report likewise relates to its own three bridges (and to mart__dim_location), not to mart__dim_client.",
